com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6VJ_-78BhtDPzeO1zX82SusX0C_PQN3JhVw9kNnxa7xQ&oe=6A145304"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2026-05-01 183526.png", "id": "1935829020397877", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823878_1935829023731210_4138014282540294142_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yyxtMKLv1cMQ7kNvwGY7Cs_&_nc_oc=Adrk1-XgYfseI5P7MfQPklesSnMAfeIwiD4AveLnor2vSJ0d33-N7o7zFfpnd0EeAoc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af54OCjARcJ-aEi85m4Dw-qDTa-RHmdSlCx-lt-DlcHLzA&oe=6A146103"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Air Distribution Systems", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Air Distribution Systems is an immersive VR training application developed by ImmerseLearn to enhance practical learning in HVAC air distribution. Designed as part of the Air Distribution Systems micro-credential program, this application enables learners to engage in realistic, scenario-based training that builds critical skills in system components, airflow management, and installation practices.\n\nThrough interactive simulations, users can explore key concepts, practice procedures, and gain confidence in a safe, controlled environment that mirrors real-world HVAC tasks. The experience is structured to reinforce theoretical knowledge through hands-on application, improving retention and job readiness.\n\nPlease note: This application is exclusively accessible to individuals enrolled in the ImmerseLearn Air Distribution Systems micro-credential program. Access is restricted and intended solely for registered learners as part of their training journey.", "short_description": "Air Distribution Systems is a VR training application from ImmerseLearn, designed to support hands-on skill development in HVAC air distribution concepts. This app is exclusively available to learners enrolled in the ImmerseLearn Air Distribution Systems micro-credential program and provides immersive, guided practice in real